  "text_sample": "Your Page Title aubergine projects menu aubergine close Services Projects Garden care About Areas Journal Free quote Overview +34 960 000 000 [email protected] Cam\u00ed de Vera 18, 46022 Valencia Reviews 4.9 on average from 212 reviews since 2011, from the people whose gardens we built and still look after. \u201cWe asked for a garden that would still look good when we are eighty. Ingrid drew one that will look better.\u201d Annika and Lars Nystr\u00f6m Villa garden in B\u00e9tera , November 2025 \u201cOur terrace was a slab of hot concrete. Now we eat out there from March to November, under the olive they planted.\u201d Luc\u00eda Ferrer Courtyard in Ruzafa , October 2025 \u201cWe used to water the lawn every evening in July. The new garden gets a drip twice a week and has never looked better.\u201d Pau Vidal Dry garden in J\u00e1vea , August 2025 \u201cThe lighting is subtle, the way we asked. You see the trees at night, not the lamps.\u201d Javier Monz\u00f3 Garden lighting in Godella , July 2025 \u201cMarta knows every plant in the garden by name and tells us which ones are sulking.\u201d Sof\u00eda Navarro Garden care in Godella, May 2025 \u201cThe quote was exact to the euro. Same crew from the first stone to the last plant, and they still come every two weeks.\u201d ",
